{"source_text": "I'm glad to hear that, and I hope you do consider doing business with us.", "target_text": "그 말을 들으니 기쁘고, 저희와 거래하는 것을 고려해 주셨으면 합니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "I'm definitely thinking about it, but I have some queries to ask you.", "target_text": "확실히 생각하고 있습니다만, 몇 가지 여쭤보고 싶은 게 있어요.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "In today's world, one in every five families has either a cat, dog, or both.", "target_text": "오늘날 세계 5가구 중 1가구는 고양이나 개 또는 둘 다를 키우고 있습니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "When you tell them, we'll take care of their child.", "target_text": "그들에게 말하면, 저희가 그 아이들을 돌볼 것입니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "OK, how about for swimming?", "target_text": "좋아요, 수영은 어떤가요?", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "We currently have two pools.", "target_text": "현재 두 개의 수영장이 있습니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "The pools are open from 8:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. every day.", "target_text": "수영장은 매일 오전 8시부터 오후 5시까지 운영됩니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "We also have the beach, which has stationed lifeguards the whole day.", "target_text": "하루 종일 인명 구조원을 배치한, 해변도 있습니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "I'd like to stay at your hotel.", "target_text": "저는 당신의 호텔에 머물고 싶습니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
{"source_text": "I noticed on the website that there is a business center.", "target_text": "웹사이트에서 비즈니스 센터가 있다는 것을 알았습니다.", "source_lang_code": "en", "target_lang_code": "ko", "pair_id": "en->ko", "teacher": {"model": "aihub", "path": "/group-volume/productivity-ai/datasets/raw/translation/aihub.en-ko-casual.71265/01.데이터/1.Training/라벨링데이터/일상생활및구어체_영한_train_set_1.json"}}
